              "printed_page": 534,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Rhinoscopy helpful for visualization of",
              "pdf_page": 616,
              "printed_page": 534,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "With definitive radiation therapy, 1-year mass or fungal plaque and guiding relapse-free survival rate around 50% and subsequent tissue biopsy. 2-year relapse-free survival rate around 30%.",
