              "printed_page": 534,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Tissue biopsy and histopathology needed",
              "pdf_page": 616,
              "printed_page": 534,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Recurrence/progression of tumor and for definitive diagnosis; biopsy instrument recurrence of clinical signs is generally should not pass the level of the medial life-limiting event for nasal/paranasal FSA. canthus of the eye to avoid penetrating the",
